Thought: To identify the SMILES string of the organic compound, I should first gather some spectral data to understand its structure. The most informative and cost-effective initial step would be to obtain the mass spectrometry spectra to determine the molecular formula, which can then be used to find possible isomers. This will help narrow down the possibilities for the SMILES string.
Action: mass_spectrometry_spectra
