Thought: The mass spectrometry data indicates a molecular ion peak at m/z 235.1395, which is likely the molecular weight of the compound. To determine the molecular formula, I should now use this information to retrieve the isotopic distribution and calculate the possible molecular formula. This will help in identifying the SMILES string by narrowing down the isomers.
Action: retrieve_isotope_distribution
Action Input: {}

